    description: "Adjacent finding of audit-findings 0021 (Step 5). Filed, not moved.\nlogging rows that write nothing at the call -- they configure or construct a logging facility, which ADR-0049's clause (\"not what the program is thereby arranged to do later\") excludes from data_crossing:\n- python logging.basicConfig, logging.StreamHandler (function rows in python.yaml's `logging` entry). NOTE: deliberate -- python.yaml's `logging` module_completeness entry says \"Module-level emitters, basicConfig, and the file/stream handler constructors rowed\". Read that rationale before deciding; the completeness entry may be why they are rows.\n- go log/slog NewTextHandler, NewJSONHandler\n- elixir Logger.metadata, Logger.configure\nEffect: each call is a `logging` taint sink; a secret passed as configuration (a handler's prefix, a metadata value) is reported as logged at a site that writes nothing. Not measured.\nFix shape (not decided): drop the rows, or keep them and state why in the audit's terms. Either way the completeness entries that list them must stay true."  # 5089
    fields: {}  # 5089
- op: discuss  # 87f8
  at: '2026-10-03T15:03:54Z'  # 87f8
  by: agent  # 87f8
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 87f8
  clock: 2  # 87f8
  nonce: 87f8  # 87f8
  message: "IMPLEMENTED on branch jgstern-agent/fix/audit0021-rows (local, not pushed), commit 7fa77400a5. Decision: DELETE all six rows (python basicConfig/StreamHandler, go slog.NewTextHandler/NewJSONHandler, elixir Logger.metadata/configure): each writes nothing at the call; the later emitter is rowed, so the crossing stays represented (ADR-0049 ruling 3, erlang io_lib precedent; erlang's logger row already leaves process-metadata setters unrowed). python's logging completeness note rewritten so it stays true (basicConfig/StreamHandler now declared not I/O, examined negatives); go/elixir calls become external_potential. Considered and rejected: basicConfig -> fs_write (only 13 of 477 corpus calls pass filename=). Taint: six logging sinks gone, no source involved. Measured A/B: fastapi-template basicConfig 4->0; Logger.configure/metadata logging->external_potential on phoenix, plausible, livebook, emqx; one host_secret->logging flow lost on phoenix-framework (Application.get_env -> Logger.configure in with_logger_app, a config restore) -- read, false. go rows: no corpus reach (fixture only). Residuals filed: WI-nikir-gamot-ligur-riron-zomad-dutoj-fobut-siror. Report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/ragaz.md (OUTCOME, draft CLOSURE NOTE, A/B artifacts in run_10032026/ragaz/). Tests: red then green on the board; branch affected-test run 9955 passed + 8 failed (7 were pins of the old rows, fixed in fdb14eb77e; 1 hypothesis health-check under load), re-run of those files 1138 passed. No status change made."  # 87f8
